msgstr "Kò sí"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Ibi tí ó wà"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Ibi gidi tí Ẹ̀rọ náà wà. Ọ̀rọ̀ òmìnira yìí lè jẹ́ yàrá, ipò àpótí ẹ̀rọ, àti bẹ́ẹ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Fún àwọn UPS tí ó da lórí SNMP, yan Ẹ̀rọ Cacti láti lò fún àwọn ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé SNMP. Bí kò bá rí bẹ́ẹ̀, yan Kò sí, àti pé àfikún UPS yóò ṣẹ̀dá Ẹ̀rọ náà fún ọ fúnra rẹ̀."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Ṣẹ̀dá fúnra rẹ̀ ní Ìwádìí Àkọ́kọ́"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Ti ṣiṣẹ́"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Sàmì sí i láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìwádìí fún dátà lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Ìròyìn APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Orúkọ olùgbàlejò ti olùgbàlejò tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ apcupsd tàbí sáfà NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Pọ́ọ̀tì TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Tẹ Pọ́ọ̀tì TCP fún UPS yìí sí i. apcupsd máa ń lo 3551 ní àìyípadà àti NUT máa ń lo 3493 ní àìyípadà."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Àkókò ìparí (ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Bí olùṣèwádìí ṣe máa dúró pẹ́ tó fún apcupsd tàbí sáfà NUT kí ó tó jáwọ́ lórí UPS yìí, láti ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá 1 sí 120. Àwọn UPS tí ó da lórí SNMP máa ń lo àkókò ìparí SNMP dípò."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Àwọn Àṣàyàn NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Orúkọ UPS NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Orúkọ UPS lórí sáfà NUT, gẹ́gẹ́ bí \"upsc -l\" ṣe tò ó (apá tí ó wà ṣáájú @ nínú ups@host). Sáfà NUT kan lè ṣiṣẹ́ fún ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ UPS."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Orúkọ Olùlò NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Àṣàyàn ni. Àkọọ́lẹ̀ upsd.users láti fi ṣe ìdánimọ̀. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo fún ààyè kíkà nìkan láìdárúkọ, èyí tí í ṣe bí a ṣe máa ń ṣàbójútó àwọn sáfà NUT lọ́pọ̀ ìgbà."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Ọ̀rọ̀ Aṣínà NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà fún Orúkọ Olùlò NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Lo TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Pa ìsopọ̀ náà mọ́ pẹ̀lú STARTTLS kí a tó fi ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé kankan ránṣẹ́. A máa ń ṣàyẹ̀wò ìwé-ẹ̀rí sáfà NUT àti orúkọ olùgbàlejò, nítorí náà olùṣèwádìí Cacti gbọ́dọ̀ fọkàn tán ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà, tàbí kí o tọ́ka sí fáìlì CA / ìwé-ẹ̀rí rẹ̀ ní ìsàlẹ̀."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Fáìlì CA / Ìwé-ẹ̀rí"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Àṣàyàn ni. Ọ̀nà kíkún lórí olùṣèwádìí Cacti sí fáìlì PEM kan tí ó gbé ìwé-ẹ̀rí CA (tàbí ìwé-ẹ̀rí sáfà tí a fọwọ́ sí fúnra rẹ̀) láti fi ṣàyẹ̀wò sáfà NUT, fún àpẹẹrẹ /etc/nut/upsd.pem. Orúkọ olùgbàlejò lókè gbọ́dọ̀ bá ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà mu."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Gba Ìwé-ẹ̀rí Tí A Fọwọ́ Sí Fúnra Rẹ̀ Láyè"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Gba ìwé-ẹ̀rí èyíkéyìí láì ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀. Ìsopọ̀ náà ṣì wà ní ìpamọ́, ṣùgbọ́n a kò fìdí sáfà NUT múlẹ̀, nítorí náà ẹnìkejì ní àárín lè ka àwọn ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé NUT. Yàn fáìlì CA / Ìwé-ẹ̀rí lókè dípò."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Àwọn Àṣàyàn SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Orúkọ olùgbàlejò ibi tí aṣojú snmp wà."

